  choices = $EXPL$["Evergreen''s ratio is misleadingly high because fully depreciated assets have minimal net book value, inflating the denominator and masking impending replacement needs","Evergreen''s ratio is genuinely superior because generating the same revenue with lower asset values proves more efficient capital management","Summit''s ratio is misleadingly low because new assets have not yet generated full-year revenue, and both ratios will converge over time","The difference is caused by different depreciation methods and has no analytical significance for capital investment decisions"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
