  choices = $EXPL$["Structure A has DFL of 1.33 and coverage of 4.0x; Structure B has DFL of 4.0 and coverage of 1.33x, with DFL near infinity signaling distress","Structure A and B have identical DFL because financial leverage depends on asset composition rather than the level of debt financing","Higher DFL always indicates lower risk because financial leverage amplifies equity returns without increasing downside exposure","DFL and interest coverage are unrelated metrics measuring entirely different aspects of financial performance and risk"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
